# Codegen

| Surface | Tool | Part / output |
|---------|------|----------------|
| Bloc event/state | freezed | `part 'foo_bloc.freezed.dart'` |
| API DTO | json_serializable | `part 'foo_model.g.dart'` |
| API client | retrofit | `part 'foo_api_client.g.dart'` |
| Routes | auto_route | `app_router.gr.dart` |
| DI | injectable | `injection.config.dart` |

## Rules

- Freezed for blocs only — **not** for API DTOs
- After adding `@injectable` / `@RoutePage` / models / Retrofit methods, run:

```bash
fvm dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs
```

- Do not hand-edit `*.g.dart`, `*.freezed.dart`, `*.gr.dart`, or `injection.config.dart`
